WEBVTT

00:00:00.753 --> 00:00:09.493
This part is for the organisers. When an event has passed, a pop-up asks whether Congo went. Tap your answer, so the analytics stay right.

00:00:09.994 --> 00:00:18.014
Open an upcoming event and tap I'm going, confirm. That's all you need as an organiser: there is no separate I'm going button for you.

00:00:18.515 --> 00:00:27.565
Plans changed? Tap Can't make it any more. Members then no longer see the event, and it doesn't count in the totals. Tap again to undo.

00:00:28.066 --> 00:00:31.366
Choose the type of event, so the colours and the counts are right.

00:00:31.867 --> 00:00:38.607
Taking the car? Fill in the free seats, where and when you leave, and tap Save. Members can then reserve a seat.

00:00:39.108 --> 00:00:43.328
The Joining tab shows, per event, who is going and who sits in which car.

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:56.920
Everything for organisers is in the Admin tab. Notifications show who is joining, new ideas and built features. Below, you invite people with their Google address, and see when each person was last online.

00:00:57.421 --> 00:01:14.981
Bug reports from members come first, in their own list. Ideas follow below. GO means it gets built, NO GO asks you for a reason, and Elaborate sends the member a question. On a GO idea, Start build now has it built at the next hourly check; otherwise it waits for the daily update.

00:01:15.483 --> 00:01:27.623
Finally, turn on phone notifications. Open the app from your home screen and tap Turn on notifications. You then get a pop-up when someone joins your car, or when a new idea or bug report arrives.

